# License

The text of the Code of Federal Regulations in this repository comes from the official annual editions and the eCFR,
published by the Office of the Federal Register (National Archives and Records Administration) and the U.S.
Government Publishing Office (https://www.govinfo.gov, https://www.ecfr.gov). It is a work of the United States
Government and is not subject to copyright in the United States (17 U.S.C. 105). Neither the Office of the Federal
Register nor the Government Publishing Office endorses this repository.

Changes made by Lexifina: each section and appendix was converted to one Markdown file, one paragraph or table row per
line; source notes, editorial notes and footnotes were left out; curly quotes were made straight and spacing was
normalised; the words of the regulations were not changed.

The arrangement of the history (which commits exist, their dates and authors), the commit messages, the tools and the
documentation are © Lexifina, released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
